</span><span id="alg1.10.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The right-side markers [B1-B4] represent the primary architectural bottlenecks on Ascend NPUs addressed in Section <a href="#S5" title="V Optimizations of ENEC ‣ ENEC: A Lossless AI Model Compression Method Enabling Fast Inference on Ascend NPUs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">V</span></a></span>
